85	## Scene kits
86	
87	A scene kit is a ready scene plus its own diagnostics. Mount one with `createAuraApp(selector, kit.toAppOptions())`. A kit built on its defaults must report no problems (`tests/unit/agent-api/scenekit-default-diagnostics.test.ts`), and each receipt shows two frames, one at start and one 90 frames later, so animated kits are proven to move. The kits supply scene content; the art direction, game rules and assets of your own product are still yours.
88	
